==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Only a single decent anti-Aku unit is really needed to beat this stage. Once Fallen Bear is down the stage is over.

